      "title": "Exceptional Circumstances Analysis under s 268(5)",
      "body_markdown": "In <a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" onclick=\"scrollToParagraph(1, 1)\" class=\"para-badge\">[1]</a>, the applicant sought review of a 3-month driver licence suspension. The Tribunal considered the meaning of **exceptional circumstances** under the predecessor provisions to s 268(5) of the *Road Transport Act 2013* (NSW). See also discussion in paragraphs <a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" onclick=\"scrollToParagraph(15, 22)\" class=\"para-badge\">[15]-[22]</a> regarding hardship and prior record.",
      "body_html": "<p>In <a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" onclick=\"scrollToParagraph(1, 1)\" class=\"para-badge\"><a href=\"#para-1\" class=\"para-jump-link\" data-jump-start=\"1\" onclick=\"app.jumpToParagraph(1)\" title=\"Jump to paragraph [1] in reader\">[1]</a></a>, the applicant sought review of a 3-month driver licence suspension. The Tribunal considered the meaning of <strong>exceptional circumstances</strong> under the predecessor provisions to s 268(5) of the <em>Road Transport Act 2013</em> (NSW). See also discussion in paragraphs <a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" onclick=\"scrollToParagraph(15, 22)\" class=\"para-badge\"><a href=\"#para-15\" class=\"para-jump-link\" data-jump-start=\"15\" data-jump-end=\"22\" onclick=\"app.jumpToParagraph(15, 22)\" title=\"Jump to paragraphs <a href=\"#para-15\" class=\"para-jump-link\" data-jump-start=\"15\" onclick=\"app.jumpToParagraph(15)\" title=\"Jump to paragraph [15] in reader\">[15]</a>-<a href=\"#para-22\" class=\"para-jump-link\" data-jump-start=\"22\" onclick=\"app.jumpToParagraph(22)\" title=\"Jump to paragraph [22] in reader\">[22]</a> in reader\"><a href=\"#para-15\" class=\"para-jump-link\" data-jump-start=\"15\" onclick=\"app.jumpToParagraph(15)\" title=\"Jump to paragraph [15] in reader\">[15]</a>–<a href=\"#para-22\" class=\"para-jump-link\" data-jump-start=\"22\" onclick=\"app.jumpToParagraph(22)\" title=\"Jump to paragraph [22] in reader\">[22]</a></a></a> regarding hardship and prior record.</p>",
      "visibility": "public",
      "status": "active",
      "version": 1,
      "created_at": "2026-10-01 02:15:39",
      "updated_at": "2026-10-01 02:15:39"
    },
