      "title": "Appellate Ratio on Disturbance",
      "body_markdown": "The Court in [84] considered valuation principles under RTA s 53 and affirmed [2010] NSWCA 236.",
      "body_html": "<p>The Court in <a href=\"#para-84\" class=\"para-jump-link\" data-jump-start=\"84\" onclick=\"app.jumpToParagraph(84)\" title=\"Jump to paragraph [84] in reader\">[84]</a> considered valuation principles under <a href=\"#/road-transport-act-2013/s53\" class=\"statute-link\" data-act=\"road-transport-act-2013\" data-sec=\"53\" title=\"Road Transport Act 2013 section 53\">RTA s 53</a> and affirmed <a href=\"#/cases/2010-nswca-236\" class=\"case-cite-link\" data-case-slug=\"2010-nswca-236\" data-mnc=\"[2010] NSWCA 236\" title=\"Open [2010] NSWCA 236 in Canopy\">[2010] NSWCA 236</a>.</p>",
