      "title": "Disqualification for 53(1)(a) and 53(3)(first) offences",
      "body_markdown": "Penalties for 53(1)(a) and 53(3) (first offence) do not include a minimum or automatic disqualification period. Nevertheless, a judge can impose a discretionary disqualification pursuant to RTA s 204.",
      "body_html": "<p>Penalties for 53(1)(a) and 53(3) (first offence) do not include a minimum or automatic disqualification period. Nevertheless, a judge can impose a discretionary disqualification pursuant to <a href=\"#/road-transport-act-2013/s204\" class=\"statute-link\" data-act=\"road-transport-act-2013\" data-sec=\"204\" title=\"Road Transport Act 2013 section 204\">RTA s 204</a>.</p>",
